  "leftOut": {
    "typed_zero_imag": "MATLAB evaluates 1+0i to the real 1; core holds the typed literal as the complex 1+0i, and writes it so, with Complexity complex to agree with it. The Value's class is not this row's question.",
    "typed_empty_then_struct": "core has no way to make a struct Value of another one: MatlabValueParser reads no struct(...), and an empty Value has no row to Add on.",
    "typed_struct_over_complex": "as typed_empty_then_struct.",
    "dimensions_set_other": "MATLAB refuses it (UDDData_CannotSetCustomDimensions); core shows Dimensions as a label, with no editor.",
